WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,700
Ha Qingyun wants to see Shen Yi

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,900
What's going on here if I'm here?

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:10,000
He wants to see you

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,840
Am I inappropriate here?

5
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,200
Who said I was going to see you?

6
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,320
If everyone asks to see me, I will meet them

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:22,900
Then how much time do I still have to do it? I just ask

8
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,820
Stay and serve my cousin

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,500
Even if you are forced into slavery

10
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,300
Should petition

11
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,980
I will never argue with you

12
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:33,070
I just want a place of honor

13
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:36,390
Please help my cousin

14
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:38,800
If I just go back like this

15
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,260
My father will never forgive me lightly

16
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:42,900
what is he doing

17
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:45,260
Want to give me a label of kindness and meanness

18
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,580
A hat that doesn't fit anyone

19
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:49,740
Or do you expect me to be merciful and accept my love rival?

20
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:51,820
You are responsible for the punishment

21
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:54,220
These are the family rules and upbringing of your He family
